DAILY CLIMATOLOGICAL SUMMARY for <%= report.month_name %> <%= day %>, <%= report.year %>

<% if daily_entry && daily_entry.has_data? %>
DAILY STATISTICS:
  Mean Temperature:     <%= daily_entry.formatted_temp(daily_entry.mean_temp) %>°F
  High Temperature:     <%= daily_entry.formatted_temp(daily_entry.high_temp) %>°F @ <%= daily_entry.high_temp_time || 'N/A' %>
  Low Temperature:      <%= daily_entry.formatted_temp(daily_entry.low_temp) %>°F @ <%= daily_entry.low_temp_time || 'N/A' %>
  Heat Degree Days:     <%= daily_entry.formatted_degree_days(daily_entry.heat_degree_days) %>
  Cool Degree Days:     <%= daily_entry.formatted_degree_days(daily_entry.cool_degree_days) %>
  Total Precipitation:  <%= daily_entry.formatted_rain %> in
  Avg Wind Speed:       <%= daily_entry.formatted_wind_speed(daily_entry.avg_wind_speed) %> mph
  High Wind Speed:      <%= daily_entry.formatted_wind_speed(daily_entry.high_wind_speed) %> mph @ <%= daily_entry.high_wind_time || 'N/A' %>
  Dominant Wind Dir:    <%= daily_entry.formatted_wind_dir %>
<% else %>
DAILY STATISTICS:
  No data available for this day.
<% end %>

                    TEMPERATURE (°F), RAIN (in), WIND SPEED (mph)

                                              HEAT   COOL          AVG
HOUR  MEAN   HIGH  TIME    LOW  TIME    DEG    DEG   RAIN   WIND   HIGH  TIME    DOM DIR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
<% entries = report.entries.hourly.for_day(day).ordered -%>
<% (0..23).each do |hour| -%>
<% entry = entries.find { |e| e.hour == hour } -%>
<%= format_hourly_text_row(hour, entry, report, day) %>
<% end -%>
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Notes:
- Times shown in 24-hour format (HH:MM) America/Los_Angeles timezone
- Hours with no data shown as "N/A"
<% if report.entries.hourly.for_day(day).any?(&:partial_period) -%>
- * Indicates partial hour (incomplete measurements)
<% end -%>
<% if generation_time -%>
- Report generated in <%= generation_time %> seconds
<% end -%>
